        "text": "Change is a Choice. This year, 245 million of you chose Binance. You chose to trade over $27 trillion across spot and futures with us. You chose to learn with Binance Academy. You chose to make us the most followed Exchange on YouTube. Regulators chose to award us the most licenses and registrations in the world. Wall street chose to enter the market, launching the first crypto ETFs, institutions and investors chose crypto. The Bitcoin ETF became the fastest selling in history and Bitcoin traded on Binance was four and a half times more than all ETFs combined. You chose the new products that got you ahead. Together, we chose to help donating over $6 million to those in need. You chose to double the volume of the New York Stock Exchange with Binance. And chose to meet the community around the world. As a wider shift paves the way for a more welcoming approach to crypto and web3 we salute everyone who has been here on the ride. The believers, creators, innovators, the community and everyone yet to join it. Change is a choice to trade, earn, invest, spend, learn, evolve. Choose crypto. Choose Binance.",
